@startuml
title MES: изменение статуса заказа (DB -> Cache Write-Through)

actor Operator as Op
participant "MES UI" as UI
participant "MES API" as API
database "MES DB (PostgreSQL)" as DB
database "Redis/KeyDB" as Cache

Op -> UI : Нажать "Взять в работу"
UI -> API : POST /orders/{id}/status {to=MANUFACTURING_STARTED}

API -> DB : BEGIN
API -> DB : UPDATE orders SET status=?, updated_at=now()\nWHERE id=? AND status=MANUFACTURING_APPROVED
DB --> API : rows_affected=1
API -> DB : COMMIT

API -> Cache : ZREM mes:orders:status:MANUFACTURING_APPROVED <order_id>
API -> Cache : ZADD mes:orders:status:MANUFACTURING_STARTED score=now <order_id>
API -> Cache : HSET mes:order:<order_id> status=MANUFACTURING_STARTED updated_at=now
API -> Cache : (опц.) ZREMRANGEBYRANK для ограничения topN

API --> UI : 200 OK (успех)
UI --> Op : заказ взят в работу

alt rows_affected=0 (гонка)
  API --> UI : 409 Conflict (уже взяли/статус изменился)
end
@enduml